    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611140/extras/764f839829ed86290b9960f4503c9eaf.avif?t=1739958903\" width=616 height=100 /></span><strong> </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the life of a self-proclaimed detective. Along with your quirky assistant Olivina, take on a seemingly ordinary case, until you unravel its hidden twists and turns that pull you through a thrilling, unique story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611140/extras/81dc4827d1b36c23fc845fa0b8988bec.poster.avif?t=1739958903\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611140/extras/81dc4827d1b36c23fc845fa0b8988bec.webm?t=1739958903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611140/extras/81dc4827d1b36c23fc845fa0b8988bec.mp4?t=1739958903\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2611140/extras/a9bc519b6c7bdce5558aea3c73874d45.webp?t=1739958903\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique investigation gameplay that challenges players to be observant</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse cast of characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smooth 2D animation that breathes life into the characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized, hand-drawn CG for players to unlock and collect</p></li></ul>",
